"""edits_s746.py -- S746_STMT_TWO_BILLS: the counted edits on /root/assetapp/stationery.py (S743's TO).

D845 (4), part A of S398_NK_SHARE_PLAN; the owner's answers 07:40 IST (two bills, NK pays its own) and 07:47 IST (an estimate paid
stays out of the accountants' packs), his FINAL 07:49 IST on the mock-up https://claude.ai/artifact/TnmxQxuSGQ48ggNVrPgBfQ: the
monthly statement holds two bills -- the Clinic's and NK Pathology's -- each joined with its own side's rates and paid on its own;
NK's paper sits on the NK Pathology lane (the join moves it there, audited), so it reaches NK's accountants' pack 8.1 by itself;
the statement reads paid once every bill on it is paid; the NK ledger shows each line by its own side's bill. Additive columns
(stationery_stmt.nk_*), made by the module's own ensure at mount and by the installer's data step. Each anchor occurs once.
"""

